#: templates/core/home.html:319
msgid "The National Directorate of Meteorology and Geophysics (Direção Nacional de Meteorologia e Geofísica - DNMG) operates under the Ministry of Transport and Communications of Timor-Leste. We provide vital weather, oceanographic, and seismic monitoring services to protect lives, property, and national infrastructure."
