msgstr "Tuirmai"

#: templates/core/about_dnmg.html:10
msgid "National Directorate of Meteorology and Geophysics"
msgstr "Direção Nacional de Meteorolojia e Geofísica"

#: templates/core/about_dnmg.html:21
msgid "Our Mission"
msgstr "Ami-nia Misaun"

#: templates/core/about_dnmg.html:23
msgid ""
"To provide reliable, responsible, and timely meteorological, climatological, "
"and geophysical information and services to support public safety, "
"contribute to national development, and actively participate in "
"international activities and cooperation."
msgstr ""
"Atualiza DNMG ne'ebé mak konfiavel, responsavel no aptu hodi suporta ba "
"protesaun seguransa ba populasaun no suseu ba dezenvolvimentu nasionál no "
"mós partisipa ativamente iha atividade Internasional."

#: templates/core/about_dnmg.html:33
msgid "Our Vision"
msgstr "Ami-nia Vizaun"

#: templates/core/about_dnmg.html:35
msgid ""
"To achieve DNMG’s vision through a clear mission focused on the following "
"key areas:"
msgstr ""
"Atu atinje vizaun DNMG nian liuhosi misaun klaru ne’ebé foka ba área "
"prinsipal sira tuir mai:"

#: templates/core/about_dnmg.html:37
msgid ""
"Analyze and understand meteorological, climatological, and geophysical "
"phenomena."
msgstr ""
"Analiza no komprende fenomena meteorolójiku, klimatolójiku no jeofíziku."

#: templates/core/about_dnmg.html:38
msgid ""
"Prepare and provide efficient, effective, and reliable meteorological, "
"climatological, and geophysical data and information."
msgstr ""
"Prepara no fornese dadus no informasaun meteorolójiku, klimatolójiku no "
"jeofíziku ne’ebé efisiente, efetivu no konfiavel."

#: templates/core/about_dnmg.html:39
msgid ""
"Fulfill and comply with international obligations and standards in the "
"fields of meteorology, climatology, and geophysics."
msgstr ""
"Kumpre no tuir obrigasaun no padraun internasionál iha área meteorolojia, "
"klimatolojia no jeofízika."

#: templates/core/about_dnmg.html:40
msgid ""
"Coordinate and facilitate activities related to meteorology, climatology, "
"and geophysics."
msgstr ""
"Koordena no fasilita atividade sira ne’ebé relasiona ho meteorolojia, "
"klimatolojia no jeofízika."

#: templates/core/about_dnmg.html:51
msgid "Our Services"
msgstr "Ami-nia Servisu"

#: templates/core/about_dnmg.html:57
msgid "24/7 Meteorological Monitoring"
msgstr "Monitorizasaun Meteorolójika 24/7"

#: templates/core/about_dnmg.html:58
msgid ""
"Continuous monitoring of weather conditions to provide timely and reliable "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Monitorizasaun kontinua ba kondisaun tempu nian atu fornese informasaun "
"pontuál no fiável."

#: templates/core/about_dnmg.html:65
msgid ""
"Early warnings for hydrometeorological and seismic events to help "
"communities and authorities prepare for potential hazards."
msgstr ""
"Avizu sedu ba eventu hidrometeorolójiku no seismiku atu ajuda komunidade no "
"autoridade sira prepara ba perigu potensiál."

#: templates/core/about_dnmg.html:71
msgid "Historical Climate Data Analysis"
msgstr "Análize Dadus Klima Istóriku"

#: templates/core/about_dnmg.html:72
msgid ""
"Analysis of historical climate data to support research, planning, decision-"
"making, and climate-related assessments."
msgstr ""
"Análize dadus klima istóriku atu apoia peskiza, planeamentu, foti desizaun "
"no avaliasaun relasiona ho klima."

#: templates/core/about_dnmg.html:78
msgid "Extreme Event Alert System"
msgstr "Sistema Alerta ba Eventu Ekstremu"

#: templates/core/about_dnmg.html:79
msgid ""
"An alert system designed to provide timely information about extreme weather "
"and other potentially hazardous events."
msgstr ""
"Sistema alerta ida ne’ebé dezenha atu fornese informasaun pontuál kona-ba "
"tempu ekstremu no eventu seluk ne’ebé bele lori perigu."

#: templates/core/about_dnmg.html:90
msgid "Our Team"
msgstr "Ami-nia Ekipa"

#: templates/core/about_dnmg.html:91
msgid ""
"We have a team of qualified professionals specializing in meteorology, "
"geophysics, and environmental sciences. Our team is committed to technical "
"excellence, reliable information, and quality public service."
